= Nikolai Sukhanov

Sukhanov (1882-1940), an Internationalist writer and a founding member of the Soviet executive, writes the best chronicle of the revolution as it happens. His wife is a Bolshevik.

**Insider Chronicler.** Sukhanov's table talk reveals what the other parties intend.

*Effect:* Relations with the Left SRs +2; relations with the Bolsheviks +2; better intelligence for the Vikzhel talks on an all-socialist government (November 1917).

*Calling on an advisor takes the turn, and then no advisor can act again for six months.*

